9. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Software includes third-party components under their own licenses. Those
licenses govern those components, and nothing here overrides them.

NOTICE.md lists every one of them, what it is used for, and what its terms
require. data/licenses/ holds the full texts, and data/licenses/FLAGS.md the
per-file terms of the flag artwork. Both are generated from tools/provenance.json
and are checked by the test suite, so they cannot fall behind what ships.
